CC   IMGT/LIGM-DB annotation level: by annotators
CC   
CC   Sequencing methodology: high redundancy shotgun.  Based on
CC   overlapping cosmids, the precision of this sequence is
CC   99.93.  Libraries were derived from two strains but there was no
CC   discernable sequence variation between them.  This sequence
CC   contains numerous internal duplications, especially in the
CC   trypsinogen genes. Interspersed Repeats were identified with
CC   RepeatMasker (available from
CC   http://ftp.genome.washington.edu/RM/RepeatMasker.html) Several new
CC   repeats were identified by Arian Smit, and these have not yet been
CC   fully classified.  Simple sequence repeats were identified with
CC   sputnik (available from
CC   http://serac.mbt.washington.edu/~chrisa/software/sputnik.html)
CC     The authors thank Christopher Nelson for his gift of cosmids from
CC   Dennis Loh's library.
